  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/IMG_9599.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La sede de Custom-Onda, en la avenida del Mar, ha acogido la noche-madrugada de este s&aacute;bado un concierto en dos sesiones del grupo local de flamenquito Los Makis, con el que la asociaci&oacute;n motera ha celebrado Halloween.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweencustomonda14/img_9536.jpg\" alt=\"img_9536\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweencustomonda14/img_9540.jpg\" alt=\"img_9540\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweencustomonda14/img_9543.jpg\" alt=\"img_9543\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweencustomonda14/img_9546.jpg\" alt=\"img_9546\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweencustomonda14/img_9549.jpg\" alt=\"img_9549\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweencustomonda14/img_9553.jpg\" alt=\"img_9553\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweencustomonda14/img_9555.jpg\" alt=\"img_9555\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweencustomonda14/img_9557.jpg\" alt=\"img_9557\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweencustomonda14/img_9560.jpg\" alt=\"img_9560\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/halloweencustomonda14/img_9561.jpg\"